WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.740
Today we are trying out something a bit more extreme.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:12.540
We are playing table tennis in the middle of this lake!

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:39.840
Alright, here begins our building process.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:40.820
Here is the raft.

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:43.320
It's going to be about 6.7 meters long.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:45.500
Yeah, it's going to be a quite big raft.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:46.560
Let's start building!

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.380
So we have four of these

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:50.780
Floating things

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:54.380
And now we are going to connect the first two.

00:00:57.340 --> 00:01:00.120
Okay, and this is our construction manager

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:00.880
Pekka

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:02.580
Nice to meet you!

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.040
He has got it all planned out

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.520
And we trust that his measurements are correct!

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:09.360
And helping us here is Patrik

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:12.240
This is going to be the middle part now.

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:13.340
Coming next.

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:18.120
Miikka is trying to learn how to use this tool.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:23.440
Maybe we should start a construction YouTube channel.

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:24.340
Maybe!

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:26.000
I like "Building Pongfinity"

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:29.500
So we have to pull it a bit more towards the lake

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:32.400
So that we get some more space to build it over there.

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:35.620
Further, further!

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:37.260
This is the length.

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:38.460
C'mon!

00:01:39.260 --> 00:01:40.680
Faster, faster!

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:42.500
Let's go, let's go!

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:45.740
This is it.

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:47.560
This thing is big.

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:49.380
Does it matter if it gets wet?

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:52.980
Remember that we are going to take it in the middle of the lake!

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:54.260
That was a stupid question!

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.500
Starting to look like something!

00:01:57.160 --> 00:01:59.200
How are you going to film from there?

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:00.020
You are going to film!

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:02.260
I'm just going for a row! Bye!

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:04.080
Emil is trying to run away

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:05.960
I will row around the island!

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:15.900
We are out here in the middle of a lake building a raft

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:18.580
Just so that we can get videos for you

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:21.140
So do us a favor and hit subscribe!

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:22.020
Do it now!

00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:25.760
It floats!

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:28.240
Okay so we have started building the floor

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:29.900
Otto and Pekka are there

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:32.860
I think we are going to run out of wood

00:02:32.860 --> 00:02:35.660
I have been doing this for like 15 minutes now

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:36.560
I know what I'm doing!

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:41.540
Or no.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:44.920
This is going to be our new training hall

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:46.920
Outside training hall!

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:50.280
So we are going to start training here in the middle of the lake!

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:56.180
I think we are wrapping things up here

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:59.200
We are going to continue tomorrow finishing the raft.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:02.780
Okay it's day 2 of building the raft

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:04.420
There it is

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.400
It's starting to look okay!

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:07.420
Let's finish this thing!

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:10.080
So we are sort of using whatever we find

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:10.900
How is the grip?

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:13.420
It's good!

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:15.900
With these sandals the grip is not the best.

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:19.920
I hope I will not end on the blooper section.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:27.660
Jackpot-Patrik

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:38.840
Soon it's like crack!

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:40.300
And everybody is in the water!

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:46.680
Almost.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:47.740
Soon.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:48.900
Soon it's going to be.

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:50.380
Coming up right after this!

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:51.760
Then we put a commercial break here.

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:53.940
Four out of four.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:59.320
We are drilling the supports onto the raft

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:01.540
So that the table won't wobble around.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.300
So they look like that.

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:10.180
If there is some people seeing us in the middle of the lake

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:11.560
What are they going to think?

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:14.540
A table tennis table on raft in the middle of a lake?

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.940
The final piece of the puzzle.

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:17.580
Yeah

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:18.820
Guys

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:20.080
There we go!

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:22.060
The raft is ready!

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:23.700
Now take a look at that!

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:27.660
It's quite good

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:47.840
Full speed ahead!

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:30.960
Almost impossible!

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:35.760
Wow!

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:37.840
Almost fell over!

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:39.420
Blooper material!

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:47.880
Picking up the balls.

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:50.900
This is so incredible to be here

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:56.700
Straight on the GoPro!

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:00.200
Looking good Emil!

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:01.120
Thank you

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:03.340
What a backhand!

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:07.420
First-person GoPro playing

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:08.960
In the middle of a lake.

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.380
C'mon! We can beat Otto!

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:32.240
Almost.

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:34.880
Well, that was a pretty good point!

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:37.060
I can't wait to play on this

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:44.540
Pretty nice!

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:56.300
The landscape is so incredible here!

00:06:58.440 --> 00:07:01.720
Okay now the raft is actually under water!

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:05.600
We have a bit of a flood situation!

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:07.820
I don't think it's a problem.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.280
This is how you train footwork on a Summer holiday!

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:34.220
Sorry!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:45.760
Okay, so we are going to do a Pongfinity diving shot tournament.

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:48.360
Vote on the comments whose dive is the best!

00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:51.680
I'm going to try to do a between the legs

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:53.380
I will try to get it on table

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:55.760
Emil is the first one to go!

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:58.260
Ready, set, go!

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:04.340
That wasn't too bad actually!

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:05.460
It was a good try!

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:06.480
C'mon!

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:08.560
Ready, set, go!

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:14.180
I was expecting you to jump far!

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:16.560
My fault.

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:18.340
That was completely your fault!

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:26.860
That was close!

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:33.280
It's a bit tiring to swim and

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:34.620
Jump onboard again

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:36.400
And jump out again

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:38.360
I'm scared!

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:40.340
Ready, set go!

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:46.700
Atleast you have to give style points for it!

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:03.980
C'mon Emil!

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.740
The worst serving ever!

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:13.300
That was close!

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:14.140
Not bad Michael!

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:15.760
Ok, last try!

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:20.840
That was so close! Really close!

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:23.780
Now we will see what the Sensei can do!

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:26.960
Ready, set, go!

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:31.580
That was really close!

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:34.820
A stylish jump though!

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:37.700
It was just one meter too short

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:45.380
Pretty good!

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:49.440
That's how you do it!

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:50.820
You still got three left!

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.080
I can do a better one

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:55.920
It wasn't a roller!

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:04.000
He wanted to make it deep!

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:08.020
He tried to hit me!

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:15.600
Oliver the sea lion

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:20.060
It won't take long until Otto has picked up all the balls!

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:22.140
Here he comes

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:26.200
You are welcome!

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:27.160
Thank you!

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:32.400
Alright guys, I think it's time to take the raft back home!

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:34.060
Remember to subscribe!

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:36.220
And watch our previous episodes there!

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:37.420
Until next time!

